Subject: [PATCH] bc250 : make r3 the persistent default on .104 with boot
 GPU-readiness service

Adds bc250-r3-gpu-ready (loads amdgpu, applies SMU-OC, restarts governor, ACKs
the r3 boot guard) and sets GRUB_DEFAULT to the r3 entry. r2 kept as menu fallback.

Assisted-by: omp
